in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai areas of the country, with mist likely during the morning hours. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi Province and at one or two places in the hilly areas of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.     "}},"sources":{"dhm_country":{"issued_at":"2026-10-02T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_city":{"issued_at":"2026-10-02T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_obs":{"issued_at":"2026-10-02T17:45:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_3day":{"issued_at":"2026-10-02T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_mountain":{"issued_at":"2026-10-02T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_pages":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_river":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_rain":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"},"model":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-02T18:28:48+05:45","status":"ok"}}}